RUN: %COMPILE build plc.json && %RUN | %CHECK %s

Each file holds one instance that prints its name in FB_INIT and in FB_EXIT.
The instances are exited in the reverse order of their initialization. The
checks capture the names in initialization order (A, B, C), so the test does
not depend on the order in which the files are linked.

CHECK: init [[A:[a-z]+]]
CHECK-NEXT: init [[B:[a-z]+]]
CHECK-NEXT: init [[C:[a-z]+]]
CHECK-NEXT: main done
CHECK-NEXT: exit [[C]]
CHECK-NEXT: exit [[B]]
CHECK-NEXT: exit [[A]]
CHECK-NOT: exit
